                                                        <h1 >
                                crafts capital 
                                 
                                    <span >historical gem</span>
                                                            </h1>
                                                            <p><p>Shaki is Azerbaijan&rsquo;s true travel gem &ndash; a small city off the forested slopes of the Greater Caucasus Mountains rich in Silk Road history and renowned for its fascinating architecture, food and friendly residents.</p></p>
